{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>מזי רעב.</b> Blasted by hunger, like ואמר למזא לאתונא על חד שבעה — they were shriveled and their skin wrinkled because of the burning pangs of hunger." "<b>ולחומי רשף.</b> They shall be attacked by coals and burning, like רשפיה רשפי אש." "<b>וקטב.</b> An expression of cutting, like אהי קטבך שאול." "<b>מרירי.</b> An expression of bitterness, like מרורת פתנים בקרבו. And in ערבי פסחים it is explained as an expression for demons, and it concludes there that there were two קטב's, one before טיהרא and one after טיהרא, as is taught there."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:50.988002490Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}